<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Diagnóstico PEM — Fase 1</title>
<style>
  :root{
    --navy:#125640;
    --navy-dk:#0D2019;
    --green-header:#163024;
    --steel:#4A5560;
    --amber:#C9922B;
    --amber-dk:#9C7220;
    --bg:#F5F2E8;
    --card:#FFFFFF;
    --line:#DCD6C4;
    --ok:#2F7D5C;
    --err:#B3402A;
    --text:#20242B;
    --muted:#6B7280;
    --sage:#9FB8AC;
  }
  *{box-sizing:border-box;}
  body{
    margin:0; background:var(--bg); color:var(--text);
    font-family: "Segoe UI", system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;
    -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
  }
  .mono{ font-family:"SFMono-Regular",Consolas,"Liberation Mono",Menlo,monospace; letter-spacing:.03em; }
  header.top{
    position:relative; overflow:hidden;
    background:linear-gradient(135deg, var(--green-header) 0%, var(--navy-dk) 100%);
    color:#fff; padding:22px 20px 20px;
    border-bottom:4px solid var(--amber);
  }
  header.top .head-row{ display:flex; align-items:flex-start; justify-content:space-between; gap:14px; }
  header.top .eyebrow{
    font-size:11px; letter-spacing:.14em; text-transform:uppercase; color:var(--sage); margin-bottom:6px; font-weight:600;
  }
  header.top h1{ margin:0; font-size:22px; font-weight:700; color:#F5F2E8; }
  header.top .sub{ font-size:13px; color:#C9D6CE; margin-top:5px; max-width:440px; line-height:1.4; }
  .logo-badge{
    flex-shrink:0; width:120px; height:120px; border-radius:50%; background:#fff;
    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; padding:16px;
    box-shadow:0 2px 10px rgba(0,0,0,.3);
  }
  .logo-badge img{ width:100%; height:100%; object-fit:contain; }
  .wrap{ max-width:640px; margin:0 auto; padding:18px 16px 60px; }
  .folio{
    display:inline-block; margin-top:10px; font-size:11px; color:#DCE9E1;
    border:1px solid #2E5647; padding:3px 8px; border-radius:3px;
  }
  /* HOME */
  .grid{ display:grid; gap:12px; margin-top:18px; }
  .card-btn{
    display:flex; align-items:center; gap:14px; background:var(--card);
    border:1px solid var(--line); border-left:5px solid var(--navy);
    border-radius:6px; padding:16px 16px; cursor:pointer; text-align:left;
    transition:transform .12s ease, box-shadow .12s ease; width:100%;
  }
  .card-btn:hover{ transform:translateY(-1px); box-shadow:0 4px 14px rgba(31,56,100,.12); }
  .card-btn .num{
    font-family:"SFMono-Regular",Consolas,monospace; font-size:20px; font-weight:700;
    color:var(--amber-dk); width:34px; flex-shrink:0;
  }
  .card-btn .t{ font-size:15px; font-weight:600; color:var(--navy); }
  .card-btn .d{ font-size:12.5px; color:var(--muted); margin-top:2px; }
  .card-btn.admin{ border-left-color:var(--steel); }
  .card-btn.admin .num{ color:var(--steel); }
  .tag{
    display:inline-block; font-size:10.5px; padding:2px 7px; border-radius:3px;
    margin-top:6px; font-weight:600; letter-spacing:.02em;
  }
  .tag.anon{ background:#EAF3EE; color:var(--ok); }
  .tag.id{ background:#FBEFE1; color:var(--amber-dk); }

  /* FORM SHELL */
  .backbar{
    display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; margin-bottom:14px; cursor:pointer;
    color:var(--navy); font-size:13.5px; font-weight:600; user-select:none;
  }
  .backbar:hover{ text-decoration:underline; }
  .panel{ background:var(--card); border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:8px; padding:20px 18px; }
  .panel h2{ margin:0 0 4px; font-size:18px; color:var(--navy); }
  .panel .meta{ font-size:12.5px; color:var(--muted); margin-bottom:18px; }
  fieldset{
    border:none; padding:0; margin:0 0 20px; border-bottom:1px solid var(--line); padding-bottom:18px;
  }
  fieldset:last-of-type{ border-bottom:none; }
  legend{
    font-size:14px; font-weight:600; color:var(--text); padding:0; margin-bottom:10px; width:100%;
  }
  .q-num{ color:var(--amber-dk); font-family:monospace; margin-right:6px; }
  label.field-label{ display:block; font-size:13.5px; font-weight:600; margin-bottom:8px; }
  input[type=text], textarea, select{
    width:100%; padding:10px 11px; border:1px solid #C9C4B6; border-radius:5px;
    font-size:14.5px; font-family:inherit; background:#FCFCFA; color:var(--text);
  }
  textarea{ min-height:70px; resize:vertical; }
  select{ appearance:auto; }
  .scale-row{ display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:8px; }
  .scale-opt{
    display:flex; align-items:flex-start; gap:10px; padding:9px 10px; border:1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius:5px; cursor:pointer; background:#FCFCFA;
  }
  .scale-opt:hover{ border-color:var(--amber); }
  .scale-opt input{ margin-top:2px; accent-color:var(--navy); }
  .scale-opt .lbl{ font-size:13.5px; line-height:1.35; }
  .scale-opt .lbl b{ font-family:monospace; color:var(--amber-dk); margin-right:5px; }
  .req{ color:var(--err); }
  .btn{
    background:var(--navy); color:#fff; border:none; padding:12px 22px; border-radius:5px;
    font-size:14.5px; font-weight:600; cursor:pointer;
  }
  .btn:hover{ background:var(--navy-dk); }
  .btn:disabled{ opacity:.55; cursor:default; }
  .btn.ghost{ background:transparent; color:var(--navy); border:1px solid var(--navy); }
  .btn.small{ padding:7px 12px; font-size:12.5px; }
  .actions{ display:flex; gap:10px; margin-top:6px; align-items:center; }
  .scale-opt:has(input:invalid){ border-color:var(--err); }
  input:invalid, select:invalid, textarea:invalid{ outline:2px solid transparent; }
  .error-msg{ color:var(--err); font-size:12.5px; margin-top:6px; display:none; }
  .success{
    text-align:center; padding:40px 16px;
  }
  .success .check{
    width:52px; height:52px; border-radius:50%; background:var(--ok); color:#fff;
    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font-size:26px; margin:0 auto 16px;
  }
  .success h2{ color:var(--ok); }
  .success .folio2{ margin-top:10px; font-size:12px; color:var(--muted); }

  /* ADMIN */
  .stat-row{ display:flex; gap:10px; flex-wrap:wrap; margin-bottom:16px; }
  .stat{
    flex:1; min-width:120px; background:var(--card); border:1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius:6px; padding:12px 14px;
  }
  .stat .n{ font-size:22px; font-weight:700; color:var(--navy); font-family:monospace; }
  .stat .l{ font-size:11.5px; color:var(--muted); text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.05em; }
  table{ width:100%; border-collapse:collapse; font-size:12.5px; margin-top:8px; }
  th,td{ text-align:left; padding:7px 8px; border-bottom:1px solid var(--line); vertical-align:top; }
  th{ background:#EFEDE6; color:var(--steel); font-size:11px; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.03em; }
  .section-title{ font-size:14px; font-weight:700; color:var(--navy); margin:22px 0 6px; }
  .warn{
    background:#FBEFE1; border:1px solid #E9C98A; color:#7A5410; font-size:12.5px;
    padding:10px 12px; border-radius:5px; margin-bottom:16px;
  }
  .loading{ text-align:center; padding:30px; color:var(--muted); font-size:13.5px; }
  .empty{ text-align:center; padding:20px; color:var(--muted); font-size:13px; font-style:italic; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header class="top">
  <div class="wrap" style="padding:0;">
    <div class="head-row">
      <div>
        <div class="eyebrow">Production Enhancement México, S. de R.L. de C.V.</div>
        <h1>Diagnóstico Organizacional PEM</h1>
        <div class="sub">Tu opinión construye el sistema de talento y desarrollo de PEM. Elige la encuesta que te corresponda — te toma unos minutos.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="logo-badge"><img src="data:image/png;base64," alt="PEM Oil & Gas"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="folio mono" id="folioTag">FOLIO —</div>
  </div>
</header>
<div class="wrap"><div id="app"></div></div>

<script>
